## Why this is the confidence artifact

Six defects had shipped into this branch's fork code and were caught here in 40 seconds:
renderToolIcon returning SVGSVGElement where the helper type says HTMLElement; an unused import and
an unused loop index (hard failures under noUnusedLocals); DOM.$('p') and DOM.$('iframe...') typed as
HTMLElement where HTMLParagraphElement / HTMLIFrameElement is required, the latter while
showUnreachable reads contentWindow off it. None are visible to transpileModule; all
are the kind that turn a first yarn compile into a 20-minute detour. tsc -p tsconfig.pulseai-check.json
is the short version of that gate - no display, no engine, no provider key, no network.

